# Statistical Analysis Tools for Learning in Engineering Laboratories.

**Authors:** Maher, Carolyn A.

## Abstract
Described are engineering programs that have used automated data acquisition systems to implement data collection and analyze experiments. Applications include a biochemical engineering laboratory, heat transfer performance, engineering materials testing, mechanical system reliability, statistical control laboratory, thermo-fluid laboratory, and a subsonic wind tunnel laboratory. (KR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ418973

